# Next.js Best Practices

## i18n Pattern

```tsx
// ✅ Use useLanguage() in client components
const { locale, dict, toggleLocale } = useLanguage();
<p>{dict.hero.name}</p>
```

## Routes

- `/` — home
- `/projects` — project list
- `/projects/[slug]` — project detail
- `/contact` — contact page

## Do Not

- Create `/en` or `/fa` route prefixes
- Hardcode strings — use dictionary files
- Use API routes (static export)
